out.push(A('Collecting everybody\'s own wrong sentence is quick and funny and it lands: almost all of them are theories. Write three on the board and turn them into descriptions together. That three minutes is the most transferable thing in Unit 18 — it works at a doctor\'s, a garage, an office and a help desk.'));
