out.push(A('Counting the free fixes across the whole class usually produces a number above eighty per cent, and it is worth writing on the board. It is also the honest answer to the question students ask about this unit — _why would anybody run a free clinic?_ — because most of what stops people is not money.'));
out.push(S('Homework (sample – the page for one person)'));
out.push(SAMPLE(['**Umm Rashid, 8 February.** She came with "it won\'t charge" and a son who told her to buy a new telephone. What it actually did was start and stop. I suggested four things: a different wire, cleaning the socket, charging from a wall, and leaving it on charge overnight to see whether it was slow rather than dead. The first one worked — the wire was bent where her grandson sat on it. **If it comes back:** it will be the socket, not the wire, and that is a job for a shop and should cost under twenty thousand. Do not let anybody sell her a telephone without showing her the old one failing in front of her.']));

