out.push(A('**a** Open — and expect it to be quiet for a moment. Somebody usually has a story. If nobody does, say that this is itself unusual and worth noticing, then move on; do not press anybody.'));
out.push(A('**b** **Not real:** the bank asking you to confirm a password (no real company ever does this); a friend asking for money quickly (the commonest one, and the one that works); winning something you did not enter.   **Could be real:** the centre saying a room has changed — and the way to be sure is to look at the address it came from, or ring the centre.'));
