out.push(S('Stage 7R · Share'));
out.push(A('This is the only homework in Book 2 that is checked by somebody outside the room, and it is worth asking about the following week — briefly, lightly, and without making anybody report a failure. In most classes two or three students come back with a story, and one of those stories is usually about something that happened long ago and was never mentioned.'));
out.push(S('Homework (sample – the family group message)'));
